LangString SnowShotClosePrompt 2052 "WingShot 正在运行。是否关闭它以继续安装？未保存的截图和录屏可能会丢失。"
LangString SnowShotCloseFailed 2052 "安装程序无法关闭 WingShot 或检查其运行状态。请手动关闭 WingShot，然后重新运行安装程序。"
LangString SnowShotLanguageTitle 2052 "WingShot 安装语言"
LangString SnowShotLanguagePrompt 2052 "请选择语言。"
LangString SnowShotUpgradePrompt 2052 "$1 已安装。$\n$\n是否先卸载旧版本，再安装新版本？"
LangString SnowShotUninstallFailed 2052 "卸载失败。"
LangString SnowShotOptionsTitle 2052 "安装选项"
LangString SnowShotOptionsDescription 2052 "选择 WingShot 的安装选项。"
LangString SnowShotPathDescription 2052 "默认情况下，WingShot 不会将其目录添加到系统 PATH。"
LangString SnowShotPathNone 2052 "不将 WingShot 添加到系统 PATH"
LangString SnowShotPathAll 2052 "为所有用户将 WingShot 添加到系统 PATH"
LangString SnowShotPathCurrent 2052 "为当前用户将 WingShot 添加到系统 PATH"
LangString SnowShotDesktopIcon 2052 "创建 WingShot 桌面快捷方式"
